<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-St George, Advance end due diligence.</title>
<headline>RTRS-St George, Advance end due diligence.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank Ltd and Advance Bank Ltd said on Friday they had satisfactorily completed due diligence and that neither party would be exercising their right of termination on their merger.</p>
</text>
